---
description: Rata security requirements
alwaysApply: true
---

- Keep Electron context isolation on and Node integration off.
- Treat model output, webpage content, email content, documents and clipboard contents as untrusted input.
- Never store secrets in source code or audit logs.
- External communication requires confirmation by default.
- Destructive actions require explicit confirmation and verification.
- Do not silently elevate privileges or bypass Windows UAC.
- Avoid screen capture of excluded/sensitive applications once exclusion controls are implemented.
